control, but when her family budget takes hit after hit during the month she's in charge as Teenage Boss, her dreams of saving money for a new double bed quickly sour.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bseX5CVhKE73QQhXDi2KMBWCesn.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-07-01\",\"runtime\":29},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Byron\",\"overview\":\"Every cent counts for thirteen-year-old Byron as he takes over Teenage Boss, but with mum and dad refusing to listen, tough rules need to be put in place.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qIR8QBgcBubwZ59HzbJSHwfOFgQ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-07-08\",\"runtime\":28},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Susan\",\"overview\":\"With a massive party for her mum's birthday to pay for as part of her monthly expenses, can fifteen-year-old Susan still save enough money for the awesome headphones she dreams of buying?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iYLf7jlXCVd17yTpLOoiiiA5syZ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-07-15\",\"runtime\":28},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Imogen\",\"overview\":\"Imogen turns her focus to saving money while in charge of her family's budget. However, her body builder dad has a massive competition to prepare for, so she needs to use her brains over brawn to manage the huge food budget.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8p2kDz0C2ea5nPCsMluTTfCMIfZ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-07-22\",\"runtime\":29},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Michael\",\"overview\":\"When fifteen-year-old Michael comes home from his first shopping trip as Teenage Boss with a new coffee machine and next to no food, his father and brother assume they are in for a rocky month.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/341BlV7AObUm3AOLPKFc7Q8Btlp.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-07-29\",\"runtime\":26},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Christabel\",\"overview\":\"It's a Rock'n Roll roll life all the way for fangirl Christabel, but by taking over the family's income, can she save enough money to buy the guitar she craves, or better still afford a holiday for her mum and siblings?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1xztJVBb7S6Z84hp9POIFfV2LOX.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-08-05\",\"runtime\":29},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Dimity\",\"overview\":\"When thirteen-year-old Dimity becomes the boss of her family for a month, she quickly discovers that unexpected school bills for her older brother and sister make saving for make-up and clothes much harder than she expected.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pmxO5dVcOXqYu9gTzPocnQInGZD.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-08-12\",\"runtime\":29},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Harry\",\"overview\":\"Harry takes control of his family's finances for a month, his desire to buy an expensive new camera with the savings ensures his parents and little sister are in for a very bumpy ride.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zgTWz8q5Y773VbI1ltrSAut3fFA.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-08-26\",\"runtime\":27},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Mikayla\",\"overview\":\"It's a steep learning curve for thirteen-year-old Mikayla when she splurges on clothes and expensive food! Will she be able to save enough during her time as Teenage Boss to look after her family and make a profit?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/clMzwWacRkpzamODUO1CyOPFr0y.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-08-26\",\"runtime\":27},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Nick\",\"overview\":\"Nick's in for a big adventure as Teenage Boss for a month. With Zoe's birthday party, Dad's holiday and mum's makeup to pay for - saving money from the family budget to buy a new pair of soccer boots isn't going to be easy.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/twGfpAInxVQivD43mVFcMOCZup0.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-02\",\"runtime\":26},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Elinya\",\"overview\":\"Elinya's old enough to be learning to drive a car, but how will she go taking the wheel of her family's finances for a month when her mum keeps secretly spending and a vet bill for Missy the dog puts her budget in jeopardy.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hiOOwohViPwAbjv0hlO37ht4bUw.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-09\",\"runtime\":28},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Ula\",\"overview\":\"When her family budget is hit with challenges, music fan Ula rises to the occasion, as Teenage Boss, she learns not just how to save money from her family budget to make money to add to it!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tcT2jr1dfnHbp5w7nJchzoTKZyl.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-16\",\"runtime\":27},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Mitchell\",\"overview\":\"Mitchell's a wiz at solving the most grown up maths problems and puzzles, but he soon learns that being the Teenage Boss of his own family for a month is just as much about puzzles with people as it is about numbers.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qVM1IzU03Y6PQi1W3EDF2KRuDDW.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-23\",\"runtime\":28},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Hayley\",\"overview\":\"Hayley loves Horses, and has her sights set on running a business based on rescuing them, but with such massive dreams at stake her parents want to give her an expense-filled month as Teenage Boss to help her prepare.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qj3H0DqHJ78o9HGRaLkU9baO72Z.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-30\",\"runtime\":28}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2018-06-24\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}